---
---
<section id="pricing" class="scroll-mt-20 py-24 md:py-32 px-6 lg:px-16 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-espresso uppercase mb-4 text-center pricing-title scroll-reveal">Pricing & Packages</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">Pilih paket yang sesuai dengan kebutuhan dan skala proyek Anda.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 pricing-cards">
      <div class="bg-offwhite rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex flex-col pricing-card">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-espresso mb-2">Basic</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-warmgrey mb-6">Cocok untuk renovasi atau rumah minimalis.</p>
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-espresso mb-6">$<span class="count-up-value" data-count="5" data-suffix="k">0</span><span class="text-lg text-warmgrey">/project</span></p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm flex-grow">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Konsultasi Awal</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Desain 2D</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ RAB (Rencana Anggaran Biaya)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-300">✗ 3D Render</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-300">✗ Pengawasan Konstruksi</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="block text-center w-full py-4 rounded-full border-2 border-espresso text-espresso font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-espresso hover:text-white transition-all">Choose Plan</a>
      </div>
      <div class="relative bg-espresso rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl flex flex-col transform md:-translate-y-4 pricing-card">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-8 bg-terracotta text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-b-lg uppercase tracking-widest">Popular</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-2">Premium</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/60 mb-6">Paket lengkap untuk pembangunan rumah baru.</p>
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white mb-6">$<span class="count-up-value" data-count="15" data-suffix="k">0</span><span class="text-lg text-white/60">/project</span></p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm text-white/80 flex-grow">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Semua fitur Basic</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Desain 3D Render</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Pengawasan Konstruksi</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Pemilihan Material</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-white/30">✗ Custom Furniture</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="block text-center w-full py-4 rounded-full bg-white text-espresso font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-terracotta hover:text-white transition-all">Choose Plan</a>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-offwhite rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex flex-col pricing-card">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-espresso mb-2">Custom</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-warmgrey mb-6">Untuk proyek skala besar dan kompleks.</p>
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-espresso mb-6">Contact Us</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm flex-grow">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Semua fitur Premium</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Custom Furniture</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Smart Home System</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Landscape Design</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Dedicated Project Manager</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="block text-center w-full py-4 rounded-full border-2 border-espresso text-espresso font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-espresso hover:text-white transition-all">Choose Plan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
